Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.70,0:00:04.78,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,Two lights shimmered.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.61,0:00:13.00,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,{\fs70.2}In this world where cold winds blow,\Nthey shimmered brightly and warmly for just an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.96,0:00:16.83,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,Something was starting to change...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.00,0:00:19.96,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,...along with the approaching winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.51,0:00:29.26,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,As the temperature dropped, she slept more often.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.81,0:00:35.27,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,Those clouds that appeared\Nseveral days ago are slowly spreading out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.48,0:00:41.32,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,The clouds will eventually cover the world, and snow will settle on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.65,0:00:45.40,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,It'll be too late if we don't hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.03,0:00:49.07,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,I knew the time to decide was now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.83,0:00:58.00,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,You stayed by me all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.71,0:01:02.76,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.09,0:01:10.10,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,What is it about that place?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.47,0:01:12.64,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,You want to go there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.89,0:01:17.23,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,But the winter's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.81,0:01:21.73,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,If it gets any colder, I won't be able to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.98,0:01:29.49,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Plus, if we leave this house,\Nwe probably won't be able to come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.41,0:01:32.08,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,You still want to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.29,0:01:36.75,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,What is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.13,0:01:46.76,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Many things that keep every day fun and a warm place?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.07,0:02:17.66,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf24}ki{\kf23}mi {\kf20}da{\kf22}ke {\kf33}ga {\kf32}su{\kf19}gi{\kf27}sa{\kf19}t{\kf39}ta {\kf48}sa{\kf43}ka {\kf42}no {\kf39}to{\kf24}chu{\kf29}u {\kf75}wa
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.07,0:02:17.66,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}The hill you once walked down...
