Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.66,0:02:23.29,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}...is now covered with many spots of sunlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.29,0:02:28.51,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf27}bo{\kf21}ku {\kf40}hi{\kf45}to{\kf43}ri {\kf85}ga {\kf24}ko{\kf22}ko {\kf43}de {\kf35}ya{\kf41}sa{\kf41}shi{\kf55}i
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.29,0:02:28.51,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}I'm standing here alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.51,0:02:36.18,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf21}a{\kf21}ta{\kf44}ta{\kf35}ka{\kf55}sa {\kf80}wo {\kf19}o{\kf27}mo{\kf44}i {\kf45}ka{\kf34}e{\kf96}shi{\kf24}te{\kf190}ru
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.51,0:02:36.18,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}remembering all the heart-warming memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.18,0:02:43.86,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,0)}{\kf45}ki{\kf47}mi {\kf61}da{\kf65}ke {\kf197}wo  {\kf24}ki{\kf65}mi {\kf61}da{\kf26}ke {\kf176}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.18,0:02:43.86,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,0)}You were the one... You were the one...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.86,0:02:50.07,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf78}su{\kf67}ki {\kf214}de {\kf65}i{\kf65}ta{\kf129}yo
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.86,0:02:50.07,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}...who I loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.07,0:02:57.83,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf44}ka{\kf43}ze {\kf64}de {\kf62}me {\kf211}ga {\kf71}ni{\kf67}ji{\kf26}n{\kf185}de
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.07,0:02:57.83,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}My eyes start to water from the wind,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.83,0:03:04.79,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf89}to{\kf44}o{\kf201}ku {\kf84}na{\kf59}ru {\kf219}yo
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.83,0:03:04.79,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}and you become a distant figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.79,0:03:07.09,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}{\kf14}i{\kf28}tsu{\kf23}ma{\kf21}de{\kf22}mo {\kf14}o{\kf26}bo{\kf25}e{\kf23}te{\kf20}ru
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.79,0:03:07.09,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}I will always remember...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.92,0:03:09.21,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf22}na{\kf18}ni{\kf21}mo {\kf26}ka{\kf21}mo {\kf27}ka{\kf18}wa{\kf19}t{\kf22}te{\kf19}mo
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.92,0:03:09.21,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}...no matter the changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.09,0:03:11.43,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf19}hi{\kf19}to{\kf26}tsu {\kf20}da{\kf19}ke {\kf23}hi{\kf19}to{\kf24}tsu {\kf23}da{\kf20}ke
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.09,0:03:11.43,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}Just this one thing, this one thing,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.18,0:03:13.93,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf24}a{\kf23}ri{\kf20}fu{\kf23}re{\kf19}ta {\kf18}mo{\kf21}no {\kf21}da{\kf29}ke{\kf40}do
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.18,0:03:13.93,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}though it's a plain thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.59,0:03:17.89,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf25}mi{\kf18}se{\kf25}te {\kf22}ya{\kf19}ru {\kf18}ka{\kf21}ga{\kf23}ya{\kf23}ki {\kf20}ni {\kf17}mi{\kf26}chi{\kf14}ta {\kf27}so{\kf26}no {\kf15}hi{\kf23}to{\kf28}tsu {\kf22}da{\kf16}ke
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.59,0:03:17.89,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}I will show it to you, this one thing covered in glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.89,0:03:23.15,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,500)}{\kf19}i{\kf28}tsu{\kf21}ma{\kf27}de{\kf17}mo {\kf14}i{\kf32}tsu{\kf19}ma{\kf21}de{\kf17}mo {\kf23}ma{\kf23}mo{\kf22}t{\kf16}te {\kf27}i{\kf200}ku
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.89,0:03:23.15,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,500)}Forever and ever, I shall hold it dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.32,0:03:29.94,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Why is there a gas stove in the resource room?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.11,0:03:36.99,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,All sorts of things that are no longer used,\Neven those that are not books, are stored here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.41,0:03:39.75,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,A good cook and gets good grades.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.75,0:03:42.25,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Good-looking and kind to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.25,0:03:45.79,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Watching Yukine-chan relaxes my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.79,0:03:47.67,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.67,0:03:49.88,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,You're always lively company.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.88,0:03:53.05,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes. It's so much fun every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.05,0:03:54.84,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,How about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.84,0:03:58.51,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Doesn't it get boring for you to be here alone every day?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.51,0:04:02.39,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,Not at all, since I frequently have visitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.39,0:04:03.69,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Visitors...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.86,0:04:10.82,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What's that guy's story?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.28,0:04:14.20,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,So what brings you here today?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.20,0:04:18.45,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Of course, I'm here to tell you how much I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.87,0:04:22.12,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I have finally realized my true feelings recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.12,0:04:23.58,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,This love for you is real!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.08,0:04:26.00,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.00,0:04:30.84,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,But I think someone better for you will show up. {1st ep7}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.84,0:04:32.67,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I got dumped instantaneously! {1st ep7}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.67,0:04:35.22,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Plus they're the exact same words as Nagisa-chan's!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.47,0:04:38.22,Default,Sud,0,0,0,,Yu-Yuki-nee...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.47,0:04:40.72,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,Sudou-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.06,0:04:44.73,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fs60\blur2\bord2\pos(960,410.000015)\3c&H4A8A5C&}Episode 7
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.06,0:04:44.73,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fs60\blur2\bord2\3c&H4A8A5C&\pos(960,720)}Where She Belongs
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.23,0:04:48.48,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Sudou-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.94,0:04:51.61,Default,Sud,0,0,0,,That was stupid of me...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.61,0:04:55.24,Default,Sud,0,0,0,,Because of me, our gang totally lost the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.95,0:04:58.37,Default,Sud,0,0,0,,I can't go back to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.99,0:05:01.29,Default,Sud,0,0,0,,I'm going off on a journey now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.70,0:05:05.00,Default,Sud,0,0,0,,I'll be a lone wolf starting today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.66,0:05:10.63,Default,Sud,0,0,0,,So I wanted to say goodbye to you before I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.84,0:05:14.51,Default,Sud,0,0,0,,Laugh at me for being such a sissy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.51,0:05:18.09,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Hey, this is the school's resource room, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.09,0:05:19.22,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.22,0:05:21.89,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Should I go get the school nurse?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.52,0:05:25.89,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,You mustn't say something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.31,0:05:30.40,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,If you leave, I think everyone will miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.69,0:05:33.15,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,I would.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.15,0:05:34.44,Default,Sud,0,0,0,,Yuki-nee.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.44,0:05:37.07,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,I'll teach you a charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.07,0:05:38.11,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,You do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.70,0:05:40.82,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,And this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.16,0:05:45.70,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,Then say, "I'm always looking at you from the side." three times.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.70,0:05:49.37,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,If you do, you'll be able to make up with your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.88,0:05:53.92,Default,Sud,0,0,0,,I'm always looking at you from the side. I'm always looking at you from the side.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.92,0:05:55.71,Default,Sud,0,0,0,,I'm always looking at you from the side.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.97,0:06:00.14,Default,Sud,0,0,0,,I feel like I see a ray of light.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.14,0:06:01.80,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What a fast recovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.80,0:06:04.31,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I should take note of that charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.31,0:06:07.43,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,All you have to do now is properly apologize to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.43,0:06:10.98,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,Running away won't solve anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.36,0:06:13.23,Default,Sud,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.15,0:06:16.82,Default,Sud,0,0,0,,I totally lost sight of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.70,0:06:22.99,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,I always say you shouldn't fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.99,0:06:27.41,Default,Sud,0,0,0,,Sorry. But there are times when men have to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.41,0:06:31.79,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey, could you explain what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.25,0:06:34.17,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.17,0:06:38.17,Default,Sud,0,0,0,,Yuki-nee's like the big-sis of our gang.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.17,0:06:39.30,Default,All,0,0,0,,Big-sis?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.30,0:06:42.76,Default,Sud,0,0,0,,We're all under the care of Yuki-nee.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.05,0:06:45.43,Default,Sud,0,0,0,,Like taking care of us after fights.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.81,0:06:47.56,Default,Sud,0,0,0,,Not just us-
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.93,0:06:49.89,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,I knew I'd find you here, Sudou!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.89,0:06:51.31,Default,Sud,0,0,0,,You followed me all the way here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.65,0:06:55.65,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,This is the only place you would hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.65,0:06:56.48,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.48,0:06:57.61,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,Please wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.40,0:07:02.16,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Yukine-san. I don't have any intention of bothering you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.16,0:07:05.16,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,You've taken care of our guys many times, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.16,0:07:07.04,Default,Sud,0,0,0,,Sorry, Yuki-nee.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.04,0:07:11.25,Default,Sud,0,0,0,,If it's come to this, no one can stop us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.25,0:07:14.71,Default,Sud,0,0,0,,Step outside! We'll bother Yuki-nee if we fight here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.71,0:07:16.38,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,You got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.38,0:07:18.26,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Sorry to bother you, Yukine-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.88,0:07:27.01,Default,Sud,0,0,0,,Yuki-nee, if another idiot like me wanders in,\Nplease take care of that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.01,0:07:27.81,Default,Sud,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.06,0:07:30.23,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,Sudou-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.69,0:07:42.20,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,My brother is the leader of the gang Sudou-san is in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.20,0:07:45.12,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, you did say how you have a scary brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.62,0:07:51.50,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,Currently in this city, two gangs are fighting over territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.16,0:07:57.63,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,My brother's group and the group the person who came later belongs to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.63,0:08:00.30,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,They're separated by a river.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.92,0:08:08.43,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,After my brother became the leader,\Nthey couldn't cross the border easily, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.31,0:08:12.18,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,...little scuffles happen every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.68,0:08:16.98,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Your brother is that scary of a person?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.27,0:08:20.15,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,Apparently, he's never lost a single fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.61,0:08:25.53,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,He tries to keep his identity and home hidden to avoid getting attacked from behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.95,0:08:28.03,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,The invisible leader!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.03,0:08:29.58,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,So cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.58,0:08:32.95,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,What's your brother's name?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.95,0:08:33.83,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,It's Kazuto.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.83,0:08:35.58,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,Miyazawa Kazuto.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.58,0:08:36.54,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.54,0:08:37.54,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Miyazawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.54,0:08:39.29,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,You're Miyazawa Yukine, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.29,0:08:40.55,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,Give me back my sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.55,0:08:44.55,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What is this? Are you with the guy from before?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.39,0:08:53.14,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,Please calm down, Okazaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.93,0:08:54.85,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.89,0:08:57.94,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.94,0:08:59.52,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.45,0:09:08.45,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,Let's talk properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.45,0:09:12.49,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,Do I know your sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.20,0:09:17.58,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,D-Don't play dumb with me!\NI know you're the boss of the gang!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.21,0:09:20.96,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Stop acting tough, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.09,0:09:23.30,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.13,0:09:26.80,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,I get it. You must be Miyazawa Kazuto.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.38,0:09:30.43,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,I heard that Miyazawa Kazuto has blond hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.43,0:09:33.93,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,You're the one that rules this side of the city, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.14,0:09:39.02,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,That's right. I am Miyazawa Kazuto.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.94,0:09:41.36,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.36,0:09:45.24,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,It's fine. Leave it to me, my beloved sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.24,0:09:48.61,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I'll play with you then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.61,0:09:51.49,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Me, the invisible leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.95,0:09:55.45,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Sunohara-san... Why? {ep6}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.45,0:09:57.83,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,He just wants to act bossy. {ep6}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.83,0:10:01.59,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,He'll be as snotty as possible to anyone who's weaker than him. {ep6}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.42,0:10:07.13,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,Um, how about we go somewhere we can sit and talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.01,0:10:12.39,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Why do we have to come to my place?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.39,0:10:15.06,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Leaders don't care about details.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.60,0:10:17.77,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,Yu-kun, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.77,0:10:21.23,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,Please let me introduce everyone for you first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.86,0:10:24.32,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,I'm Miyazawa Yukine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.32,0:10:25.44,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.44,0:10:26.69,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,H-Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.44,0:10:31.91,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,They are Okazaki Tomoya-san and Furukawa Nagisa-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.24,0:10:33.53,Default,All,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.53,0:10:36.20,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,You have good manners, Yu-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.20,0:10:38.66,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,D-Don't try to flatter me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.66,0:10:42.79,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I was hoping for something more savage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.79,0:10:47.46,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,If I'm not mistaken, your sister went missing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.46,0:10:50.55,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,She ran away from our house and joined your gang.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.26,0:10:56.85,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,I asked my friend's brother, and he said that the boss of the group is the Miyazawa kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.85,0:10:59.81,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,and that the younger sister of the two is a student at Hikarizaka High School.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.81,0:11:02.94,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,So you've come to claim your sister back, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.94,0:11:05.32,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,You're very brave, Yu-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.65,0:11:08.28,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,Miyazawa Kazuto is the invisible boss,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.28,0:11:11.28,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,and I'm told that only those in his group know his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.28,0:11:14.91,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,That's why I came to talk with the sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.91,0:11:17.99,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,How old is your sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.37,0:11:21.16,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,I think she was twenty-one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.88,0:11:27.46,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,We got a call from her the other day saying she wouldn't be back for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.46,0:11:30.01,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,That she'll lease an apartment and live alone for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.51,0:11:33.34,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Is that something to worry about?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.34,0:11:37.26,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Look. You're just a sis-con.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.26,0:11:38.47,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,Sis-con?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.47,0:11:42.98,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,When a twenty-one year old leaves home, it's called going independent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.98,0:11:45.19,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,There's no need for a kid to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.19,0:11:48.61,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,But she's dating a guy in a gang.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.23,0:11:56.53,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,Um, I don't know what exactly you were told,\Nbut my friends aren't bad people.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.03,0:12:02.37,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,They are a little short-tempered and quick to fight, but they're all very manly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.37,0:12:05.83,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,How about us? Do we look like that bad of people?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.29,0:12:07.75,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,You do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.38,0:12:10.38,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,But she looks like a nice person.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.01,0:12:13.05,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.05,0:12:14.47,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Not cute at all...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.47,0:12:17.35,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Yu. You're a seed from a flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.81,0:12:21.35,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,You'll be blown away by the wind and start your journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.35,0:12:24.85,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,You're on your way to meet new people in new places.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.19,0:12:28.23,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,Meet new people in new places?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.69,0:12:31.28,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,You can't be spoiled by your sister anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.74,0:12:34.28,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Even if you're apart, you're still connected by a bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.28,0:12:36.66,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,That's what family is!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.12,0:12:41.29,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sunohara is giving a proper lecture.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.29,0:12:46.00,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm sure he thought things through after what happened with Mei-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.00,0:12:53.88,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,But I'm sure you'd be worried to not know where your sister is, so I'll ask my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.88,0:12:55.51,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,Is that all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.84,0:12:57.64,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.64,0:13:03.06,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,Please look for my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.06,0:13:04.68,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,Thank you for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.68,0:13:07.52,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,Yes. I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.52,0:13:10.61,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Things were settled peacefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.61,0:13:14.03,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I think it's Miyazawa-san's charisma.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.03,0:13:15.45,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,She's wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.24,0:13:22.54,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,How did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.37,0:13:27.25,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,He wants to follow me and learn about being a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.25,0:13:30.54,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,He's got real guts to skip school for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.54,0:13:31.92,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,Thank you for taking me in!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.92,0:13:35.34,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,If you watch me, you'll learn how a man should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.34,0:13:37.01,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Don't fall behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.01,0:13:37.68,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.73,0:13:47.48,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,Hey, the bell rang.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.48,0:13:49.40,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Yeah, it did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.40,0:13:51.23,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,Didn't class start?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.11,0:13:55.40,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,As long as you're doing what you're supposed to, you don't have to attend classes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.40,0:13:57.11,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,That's the law of the society.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.65,0:13:59.36,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,Does he do what he's supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.36,0:14:00.32,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.32,0:14:01.66,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,You don't either!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.66,0:14:04.29,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I have been attending class regularly these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.58,0:14:06.75,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm here only because of you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.75,0:14:09.50,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,Could you two be bums?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.50,0:14:11.88,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,He is, but I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.88,0:14:13.46,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Stop spilling the beans!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.46,0:14:15.51,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,You're ruining the dignity of the teacher!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.51,0:14:17.26,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You intended this to be a lesson for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.26,0:14:19.84,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,You've heard of teachers who are abominable role models, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.84,0:14:22.30,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I'm trying to be one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.30,0:14:24.56,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Do you even know what that means?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.56,0:14:28.14,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,No, but the word sounds cool, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.89,0:14:31.69,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey, someone's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.65,0:14:33.77,Default,Teacher,0,0,0,,Is someone in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.91,0:14:46.20,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.20,0:14:47.79,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Way to be found so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.79,0:14:50.04,Default,Teacher,0,0,0,,The class has already started, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.54,0:14:54.88,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Sorry. I lost track of time playing hide and seek.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.88,0:14:56.42,Default,Teacher,0,0,0,,Hide and seek?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.42,0:14:57.88,Default,Teacher,0,0,0,,So there are others hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.34,0:15:01.51,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Hey, Okazaki. Come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.89,0:15:03.14,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,This sucks. {ep6}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.47,0:15:06.47,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,What happened after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.47,0:15:10.60,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We got taken away with him and got lectured.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.60,0:15:14.02,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,It's unfair for only me to be caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.02,0:15:16.69,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,Hey, is this part of being manly?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.69,0:15:19.82,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,As an abominable role model, he's doing a great job.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.82,0:15:20.57,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,You could say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.74,0:15:24.87,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,We got ahold of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.87,0:15:28.20,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,We know where your sister is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.50,0:15:35.17,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,Your sister wants to see you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.71,0:15:39.88,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,She said she'll be waiting at the store where everyone gathers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.88,0:15:41.88,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,Thank you, Yukine Onee-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.47,0:15:45.14,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Why do we need to come along?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.14,0:15:47.68,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I wouldn't want to get dragged into another fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.68,0:15:52.35,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,When that happens, you'll take care of things, right, Kazuto Bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.73,0:15:56.31,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,When bad guys show up,\Nbeat them up for us please, Kazuto-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.94,0:16:00.40,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I wouldn't want you to rely on me so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.74,0:16:11.58,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It's my first time coming to a place like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.87,0:16:16.13,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,It's fine. They're all friendly people.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.13,0:16:22.13,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, coming here will expose that I'm not Yukine-chan's brother, won't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.13,0:16:24.43,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You just realized that now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.43,0:16:24.97,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I'm going home!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.34,0:16:27.10,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,We've come this far. {ep6}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.10,0:16:28.10,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Come with us. {ep6}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.35,0:16:30.60,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.31,0:16:32.31,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,Yuki-nee!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.81,0:16:34.44,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,Long time no see, Yuki-nee.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.44,0:16:36.19,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,We've been waiting for you, Yuki-nee.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.19,0:16:38.27,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,I'm glad to see that you're all well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.94,0:16:40.53,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,Onee-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.48,0:16:42.32,Default,Onee,0,0,0,,Yu!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.74,0:16:48.03,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,I was worried about you, Onee-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.03,0:16:51.45,Default,Onee,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. But I'm doing fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.45,0:16:53.37,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,That's your little brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.37,0:16:54.58,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,He's so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.58,0:16:57.54,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,He's got a good strong face.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.54,0:16:59.92,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,How about it? Want a drink to go with the reunion?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.92,0:17:01.84,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,No alcohol.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.84,0:17:03.46,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,I was just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.46,0:17:07.84,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Looks like Sudou-san was able to make up with everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.84,0:17:10.43,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Miyazawa's really popular, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.43,0:17:15.48,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Yuki-nee treats anyone who's wounded, regardless of being friend or foe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.48,0:17:18.60,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,There are many who have been cared for by her after a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.60,0:17:20.23,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You're the guy from that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.23,0:17:24.69,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Yeah. Sorry I couldn't give much of an introduction that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.69,0:17:26.99,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,No, same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.16,0:17:30.45,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,You got another guy there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.03,0:17:33.91,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I'm not worthy of introducing myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.00,0:17:42.88,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Kazuto-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.76,0:17:47.93,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.72,0:17:55.10,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,You're still bothering Yuki-nee?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.10,0:17:57.73,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm just her friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.73,0:18:00.40,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,He isn't Miyazawa Kazuto-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.06,0:18:03.48,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,What? You were lying to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.15,0:18:09.03,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,L-Look, I'm in the theater club,\Nso I wanted to practice my acting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.03,0:18:12.08,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,To pretend to be Kazuto-san of all people.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.08,0:18:13.45,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,You piece of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.45,0:18:16.95,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,If you weren't Yuki-nee's friend, you would be dead now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.95,0:18:23.59,Default,Onee,0,0,0,,Calm down. He did take care of my brother, so could you let him off the hook?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.59,0:18:25.59,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,You won't do it again, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.67,0:18:29.84,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Bro! Sis! I'll follow you forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.89,0:18:34.39,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,I heard from Yu-kun yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.72,0:18:38.98,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,His family is having a problem between parent and child.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.39,0:18:45.36,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,The other day, his sister left home as a result of a fight with their mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.61,0:18:50.82,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,Many of those who are here aren't on good terms with their parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.82,0:18:57.41,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,They don't have a place for them at home, so they come to a place like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.87,0:19:02.08,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,So to them, this is like their home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.67,0:19:04.21,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,It was the same with my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.21,0:19:08.21,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,He didn't get along with my parents very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.97,0:19:15.97,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I was once told that when there's a family-like group, people don't stray from the path too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.68,0:19:22.10,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Apparently her family had a bad parent-child relationship and the house was cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.48,0:19:24.86,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,What happened to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.73,0:19:29.15,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,A lot has happened, but apparently they're doing fine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.61,0:19:32.74,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,I see. That's good to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.41,0:19:37.03,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,You're a pretty interesting guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.03,0:19:38.16,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,A-Am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.16,0:19:39.50,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,Enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.79,0:19:42.58,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.96,0:19:41.71,Default-alt,Oka,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.58,0:19:43.33,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,Do not mention it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.71,0:19:47.50,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Um, won't Kazuto-san be coming here today?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.09,0:19:49.26,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,My brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.26,0:19:52.09,Default,Sud,0,0,0,,Kazuto-san's in the hospital right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.59,0:19:55.68,Default,Sud,0,0,0,,He saved a buddy and got in a car accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.68,0:19:57.05,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Car accident?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.51,0:20:03.94,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Kazuto-san was an employee here,\Nbut now a group of us take care of the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.02,0:20:08.57,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,I'm helping in the kitchen from time to time, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.57,0:20:12.65,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Kazuto-san's a wonderful person the more I hear about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.65,0:20:18.87,Default,Sud,0,0,0,,That's right. We can live without going astray thanks to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.87,0:20:20.66,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Is there a picture of him or anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.66,0:20:22.75,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'd like to see what he looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.75,0:20:28.96,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,I don't have a picture of him,\Nbut everyone says that I look like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.38,0:20:30.67,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.67,0:20:31.38,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.89,0:20:39.85,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,That was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.85,0:20:42.27,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,My life just got shortened a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.27,0:20:46.44,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You should be happier since you got to act like the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.32,0:20:50.98,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,You're Miyazawa Kazuto, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.98,0:20:52.32,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,What? Me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.32,0:20:56.57,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,We finally meet! I didn't know you were out of the hospital!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.57,0:20:58.45,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,We'll settle this today once and for all!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.08,0:21:00.16,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,You're making a mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.16,0:21:01.83,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,Please wait! He's-
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.83,0:21:04.62,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Yukine-san, sorry but you can't stop us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.62,0:21:06.87,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Don't hurt Yukine-san and the other girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.87,0:21:07.67,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.67,0:21:09.04,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Crap. Lets get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.46,0:21:10.92,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.89,0:21:21.97,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,Wha... What just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.97,0:21:25.06,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,That's the power of Miyazawa Kazuto?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.06,0:21:26.35,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,It's frightening.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.35,0:21:29.06,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,That wasn't human...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.69,0:21:35.32,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,You're the ones who came running at me,\Nand what a rude thing to say!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.32,0:21:36.65,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoyo-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.07,0:21:38.74,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,You saved us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.74,0:21:41.58,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What are you doing in a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.58,0:21:45.16,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,I heard many fights have happened here recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.71,0:21:49.75,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,I was on a patrol since I don't want students from our school to get involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.75,0:21:53.75,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,You guys, too. Why are you\Ninvolved with people like them?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.30,0:21:56.97,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It's a long story...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.18,0:22:02.31,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I think they totally have the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.31,0:22:03.51,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Looks that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.81,0:22:09.77,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\4c&H000000&\shad3\pos(1459.999969,840)\bord0.75\3c&H000000&\blur0.5}To be continued
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.70,0:22:26.20,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf24}mi{\kf32}tsu{\kf23}me{\kf23}te {\kf19}i{\kf137}ta {\kf29}na{\kf28}ga{\kf21}re{\kf69}ru {\kf60}ku{\kf61}mo {\kf230}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.70,0:22:26.20,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I was gazing at the drifting clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.20,0:22:33.25,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}{\kf40}ka{\kf11}n{\kf24}ji{\kf21}te {\kf30}i{\kf135}ta {\kf28}ka{\kf23}wa{\kf19}ru {\kf68}so{\kf63}ra {\kf37}no {\kf45}i{\kf26}ro {\kf130}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.20,0:22:33.25,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}I was feeling the changes in the sky's color.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.75,0:22:41.30,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf25}ta{\kf31}chi {\kf20}to{\kf27}ma{\kf21}t{\kf142}ta {\kf22}bo{\kf23}ku{\kf26}ra {\kf66}wa {\kf63}ki{\kf59}zu{\kf229}ku
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.75,0:22:41.30,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}As we stop walking,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.30,0:22:48.39,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf24}u{\kf32}tsu{\kf25}ro{\kf21}i {\kf20}yu{\kf143}ku {\kf24}se{\kf25}ka{\kf23}i {\kf65}ga {\kf73}tsu{\kf26}mu{\kf49}gu {\kf18}u{\kf32}ta {\kf113}ni
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.30,0:22:48.39,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}we hear the song the world sings as its colors fade.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.39,0:22:55.69,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf91}no{\kf35}ba{\kf38}shi{\kf139}ta {\kf48}yu{\kf25}bi {\kf44}de {\kf29}ta{\kf90}gu{\kf24}ru {\kf44}yo{\kf24}u {\kf98}ni
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.39,0:22:55.69,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Just as you scan with the fingers you spread,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.69,0:23:04.33,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf26}ta{\kf92}da {\kf34}hi{\kf38}to{\kf87}tsu {\kf55}ka{\kf44}wa{\kf23}ra{\kf48}na{\kf29}i {\kf44}mo{\kf47}no {\kf22}sa{\kf95}ga{\kf177}su
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.69,0:23:04.33,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I search for the one thing that never changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.37,0:23:11.92,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf59}ka{\kf41}za{\kf74}su {\kf72}te {\kf138}ni {\kf46}to{\kf45}mo{\kf75}shi{\kf73}bi {\kf136}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.37,0:23:11.92,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}Let there be a torch in the hand you reach out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.92,0:23:19.47,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf46}a{\kf52}su {\kf72}he {\kf24}to {\kf46}tsu{\kf25}zu{\kf108}ku {\kf44}chi{\kf33}i{\kf26}sa{\kf61}na {\kf78}shi{\kf71}ru{\kf73}be
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.92,0:23:19.47,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}There'll be a small sign leading to tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.47,0:23:27.01,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf44}i{\kf52}ma {\kf70}mo {\kf67}ma{\kf144}da {\kf45}ko{\kf46}da{\kf63}ma {\kf80}su{\kf140}ru
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.47,0:23:27.01,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The word you said that day...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.01,0:23:34.52,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf48}a{\kf46}no {\kf70}hi {\kf27}no {\kf44}ko{\kf26}to{\kf104}ba {\kf51}chi{\kf30}ka{\kf27}i {\kf93}ni {\kf71}ka{\kf113}e
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.01,0:23:34.52,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}...still echoes in my head, and let's make it an oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.52,0:23:39.78,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf42}bo{\kf34}ku {\kf18}wa {\kf166}yu{\kf266}ku
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.52,0:23:39.78,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I will continue going with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.78,0:23:43.74,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs99.999996\fad(0,400)\4c&H000000&\shad3\pos(960,470.000015)\blur0.5\bord0.75\3c&H000000&}Preview
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.24,0:23:46.62,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Your brother doesn't know what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.91,0:23:50.58,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Even if he's in the hospital, can't he convince Sudou and the others over the phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.41,0:23:53.17,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Here's my advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.17,0:23:56.17,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Stop being a fool and be friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.01,0:24:07.93,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Kazuto-san can stop the fight, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.68,0:24:09.64,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\4c&H000000&\shad3\pos(960,405)\bord0.75\blur0.5\3c&H00000A&}Episode 8
